{%- comment -%}
  Frutiferia Web 4.0 — Selector de audiencia "3 puertas" — "Lista editorial".

  Reemplaza la version de tarjetas (3 columnas simetricas con borde, sombra y filete de 4px).
  Resultado de un panel de 4 variantes juzgadas por 3 lentes (marca / conversion / craft):
  la ARQUITECTURA es una lista 1-D (no hay retícula que romper: agregar, quitar o reordenar
  puertas desde el Theme Editor solo agrega, quita o reordena <li>), el ESTILO es editorial
  (sin tarjeta, sin borde de caja, sin sombra, sin iconos de puerta) y la JERARQUIA la da
  un solo boton solido, en menta, en la puerta marcada como destacada.

  Decisiones que NO son cosmeticas — si las tocas, revisa el porque:
  · El riel y los textos de canal usan --pill-*-ink, no --pill-* puro: el canal puro como
    TEXTO reprueba WCAG AA. Los cuatro valores viejos reprobaban (el celeste de B2C daba
    2,14:1 sobre blanco); el rebranding 2026-08 los oscurecio y saco a B2B del violeta,
    que era el mismo color de la marca. Los tokens ya traen el valor nuevo.
  · El boton menta lleva texto y hairline en tinta: blanco sobre menta da 2,54:1, y el
    relleno menta solo da 2,25:1 contra la banda lila (WCAG 1.4.11 pide 3:1 para identificar
    un control), asi que el hairline es funcional, no decorativo.
  · El verbo del CTA es visible en TODOS los anchos. Nada de flecha pelada en movil.
  · Righteous aparece UNA sola vez (el eyebrow de seccion). La marca rinde por escasez.

  WUX-1 (2026-08-17) agrega un segundo layout, "tira", sin borrar el editorial:
  UNA fila de 3 pastillas (<=72px escritorio / <=120px movil) para que el selector deje
  de costar 548px de scroll antes de ver producto. El editorial se queda entero: volver
  atras es cambiar un select en el Theme Editor, no revertir un commit.
  En "tira" NO se rinden el eyebrow, la pregunta ni la bajada — son justamente los que
  hacian alta la seccion, y las tres pastillas ya se explican solas.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign heading_id = section.id | append: '-q'
-%}

<style>
  #{{ section.id }}.audience-doors {
    background: {% if section.settings.band %}var(--surface-muted){% else %}var(--surface){% endif %};
    padding: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 72px) 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} *,
  #{{ section.id }} *::before,
  #{{ section.id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* ---------- Enunciado ---------- */

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-brand);          /* Righteous: unica aparicion de la seccion */
    font-size: var(--fs-marker);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);             /* 8,66:1 sobre la banda */
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__question {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.2vw, 44px);
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
    letter-spacing: -.015em;
    color: var(--text);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__support {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);                /* 6,62:1 sobre la banda */
    max-width: 34ch;
  }

  /* ---------- La lista ---------- */

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__list { display: grid; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__item { margin: 0; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__item + .audience-doors__item { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 20px 16px 20px 22px;
    min-height: 96px;                        /* la fila ENTERA es el enlace */
    align-content: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background: transparent;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    transition: background-color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-areas:
      "id"
      "answer"
      "meta"
      "act";
  }

  /* Riel de canal: siempre visible, nunca depende del hover. */
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: 3px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-photo);
    background: var(--door-ink);
    transition: width var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
  }

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__id { grid-area: id; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);           /* Inter, no Righteous */
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--door-ink);
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__name {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__answer {
    grid-area: answer;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__meta {
    grid-area: meta;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);                /* 6,62:1 — nunca --text-caption */
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px 8px;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__sep { color: var(--text-muted); opacity: .55; }

  /* La prueba que cierra el B2B: el TEXTO va en tinta (15,5:1) y el verde queda solo
     en el glifo, que como elemento grafico califica con 3,63:1 > 3:1. */
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__check {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__check svg {
    width: 13px; height: 13px; display: block;
    color: var(--text-positive);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---------- Accion ---------- */

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act {
    grid-area: act;
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    justify-self: start;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--door-ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act-label { position: relative; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act-label::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0; bottom: -3px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left center;
    transition: transform var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:hover .audience-door__act-label::after,
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:focus-visible .audience-door__act-label::after { transform: scaleX(1); }

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__arrow {
    width: 18px; height: 18px; display: block;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    transition: transform var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:hover .audience-door__arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

  /* ---------- La puerta destacada ---------- */

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead::before { width: 6px; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead .audience-door__name { font-size: 25px; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead .audience-door__act {
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 13px 24px;
    background: var(--color-cta);
    color: var(--on-cta);
    border: 1px solid var(--on-cta);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    transition: background-color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead .audience-door__act-label::after { display: none; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead:hover .audience-door__act {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fru-blanco) 14%, var(--color-cta));
  }

  /* ---------- Estados ---------- */

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:hover {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--door-accent) 7%, var(--surface));
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:hover::before { width: 8px; }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    outline-offset: -3px;                    /* hacia adentro: las filas son adyacentes */
  }

  /* Tactil: ninguna afordancia existe solo en hover. */
  @media (hover: none) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act-label::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead .audience-door__act-label::after { display: none; }
  }

  /* Sin color-mix el lavado cae a blanco solido; el color de canal NO se pierde
     porque --door-ink es un token con hex propio, no un color-mix. */
  @supports not (color: color-mix(in srgb, #000, #fff)) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:hover { background: var(--surface); }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead:hover .audience-door__act { background: var(--color-cta); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door,
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door::before,
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__arrow,
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act,
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act-label::after { transition: none; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door:hover .audience-door__arrow { transform: none; }
  }

  /* ---------- >=750px: la fila se vuelve horizontal ----------
     `auto` en la columna de accion + `minmax(0,1fr)` en el texto: por larga que sea
     la etiqueta que escriba el comerciante, la seccion nunca desborda. */
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 240px) minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      grid-template-areas:
        "id answer act"
        "id meta   act";
      align-items: center;
      gap: 3px var(--space-3);
      padding: 22px 20px 22px 26px;
      min-height: 92px;
    }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__id { align-self: center; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__act { align-self: center; margin-top: 0; justify-self: end; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__answer { align-self: end; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__meta { align-self: start; }
  }

  /* ---------- >=1100px: enunciado a la izquierda ----------
     1100 y no 990: bajo 1100 la columna de texto de la fila se estrangula. */
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 240px) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-4);
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 var(--space-3);
    }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-doors__question { font-size: clamp(32px, 3vw, 40px); }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door__name { font-size: 23px; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-door--lead .audience-door__name { font-size: 27px; }
  }

  /* ==========================================================================
     Layout "tira" — una sola fila de pastillas.
     Va DESPUES del editorial a proposito: misma especificidad (#id + clase), gana
     el orden de aparicion. Contraste calculado contra blanco:
       relleno suave = canal al 14% sobre --surface; texto = --pill-*-ink
       hogar   #03546D sobre #DCEBEF -> 6,90:1 (en hover, al 20%: 6,30:1)
       equipo  #9A196A sobre #F5E1EE -> 6,20:1 (en hover, al 20%: 5,62:1)
       negocio (solida) blanco sobre #2525C1 -> 9,94:1
     ========================================================================== */

  #{{ section.id }}.audience-doors--strip {
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-strip {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-strip__item { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }

  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 64px;
    padding: 10px 10px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--door-accent) 32%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--door-accent) 14%, var(--surface));
    color: var(--door-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-wrap: balance;
    transition:
      background-color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out),
      transform var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill:hover {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--door-accent) 20%, var(--surface));
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill:active { transform: translateY(0); }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* La que trae caja va solida: es la unica jerarquia de la tira. */
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill--lead {
    background: var(--door-accent);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: var(--fru-blanco);
  }
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill--lead:hover {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fru-blanco) 12%, var(--door-accent));
  }

  @supports not (color: color-mix(in srgb, #000, #fff)) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill { background: var(--surface-muted); }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill:hover { background: var(--surface-muted); }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill--lead,
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill--lead:hover { background: var(--door-accent); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill { transition: none; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill:hover { transform: none; }
  }

  /* Etiqueta corta bajo 400px (iPhone SE / mini): con 3 columnas de ~110px
     "Para mi negocio" se parte en tres lineas y estira la tira. La pastilla
     conserva sus 64px de alto minimo — el tap target NO se toca. */
  #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill__short { display: none; }

  @media (max-width: 399px) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-strip { gap: 6px; padding: 0 14px; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill {
      min-height: 64px;
      padding: 10px 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill--has-short .audience-pill__long { display: none; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill--has-short .audience-pill__short { display: inline; }
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-strip { gap: 12px; }
    #{{ section.id }} .audience-pill {
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>

{%- if section.settings.layout == 'strip' -%}

<section
  class="audience-doors audience-doors--strip"
  id="{{ section.id }}"
  aria-label="{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Compro para' | escape }}"
>
  <ul class="audience-strip">
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- liquid
        case block.settings.channel
          when 'b2b'
            assign accent = 'var(--pill-b2b)'
            assign ink = 'var(--pill-b2b-ink)'
          when 'wellness'
            assign accent = 'var(--pill-wellness)'
            assign ink = 'var(--pill-wellness-ink)'
          when 'b2g'
            assign accent = 'var(--pill-b2g)'
            assign ink = 'var(--pill-b2g-ink)'
          else
            assign accent = 'var(--pill-b2c)'
            assign ink = 'var(--pill-b2c-ink)'
        endcase
      -%}
      <li class="audience-strip__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <a
          class="audience-pill{% if block.settings.lead %} audience-pill--lead{% endif %}{% if block.settings.name_short != blank %} audience-pill--has-short{% endif %}"
          style="--door-accent: {{ accent }}; --door-ink: {{ ink }};"
          href="{{ block.settings.cta_link | default: '#' }}"
        ><span class="audience-pill__long">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</span>{%- if block.settings.name_short != blank -%}<span class="audience-pill__short">{{ block.settings.name_short | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}</a>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</section>

{%- else -%}

<section
  class="audience-doors"
  id="{{ section.id }}"
  {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}aria-labelledby="{{ heading_id }}"{% endif %}
  {% if settings.animations_enabled != "disabled" and section.settings.prevent_animation == false %}data-cc-animate{% endif %}
>
  <div class="audience-doors__inner">

    <div class="audience-doors__ask">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="audience-doors__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="audience-doors__question" id="{{ heading_id }}">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.support != blank -%}
        <p class="audience-doors__support">{{ section.settings.support | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <ul class="audience-doors__list">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          case block.settings.channel
            when 'b2b'
              assign accent = 'var(--pill-b2b)'
              assign ink = 'var(--pill-b2b-ink)'
            when 'wellness'
              assign accent = 'var(--pill-wellness)'
              assign ink = 'var(--pill-wellness-ink)'
            when 'b2g'
              assign accent = 'var(--pill-b2g)'
              assign ink = 'var(--pill-b2g-ink)'
            else
              assign accent = 'var(--pill-b2c)'
              assign ink = 'var(--pill-b2c-ink)'
          endcase
        -%}
        <li class="audience-doors__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <a
            class="audience-door{% if block.settings.lead %} audience-door--lead{% endif %}"
            style="--door-accent: {{ accent }}; --door-ink: {{ ink }};"
            href="{{ block.settings.cta_link | default: '#' }}"
          >
            <span class="audience-door__id">
              {%- if block.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
                <span class="audience-door__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.name != blank -%}
                <span class="audience-door__name">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>

            {%- if block.settings.answer != blank -%}
              <span class="audience-door__answer">{{ block.settings.answer | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.meta != blank or block.settings.proof != blank -%}
              <span class="audience-door__meta">
                {%- assign meta_parts = block.settings.meta | split: '·' -%}
                {%- for part in meta_parts -%}
                  {%- assign piece = part | strip -%}
                  {%- if piece != blank -%}
                    {%- unless forloop.first -%}
                      <span class="audience-door__sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                    {%- endunless -%}
                    <span>{{ piece | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
                {%- if block.settings.proof != blank -%}
                  {%- if meta_parts.size > 0 -%}
                    <span class="audience-door__sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <span class="audience-door__check">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                      <path d="M4 12.6 9.2 17.8 20 6.8"/>
                    </svg>
                    {{ block.settings.proof | escape }}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.cta_label != blank -%}
              <span class="audience-door__act">
                <span class="audience-door__act-label">{{ block.settings.cta_label | escape }}</span>
                <svg class="audience-door__arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                  <path d="M4.5 12h13"/><path d="M12.4 6.9 17.5 12l-5.1 5.1"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Selector de audiencia",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "cc-audience-doors",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Formato",
      "info": "En «Tira» solo se ven las tres pastillas: el título y la bajada no se muestran.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "editorial", "label": "Editorial (lista con bajadas)" },
        { "value": "strip", "label": "Tira (una fila de pastillas)" }
      ],
      "default": "editorial"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Etiqueta superior",
      "info": "Va en Righteous, la fuente de la marca. Es su única aparición en la sección: mantenla corta.",
      "default": "Empieza aquí"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Pregunta",
      "default": "¿Para quién compras hoy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "support",
      "label": "Bajada",
      "default": "Una casa, una cocina y una oficina no compran igual."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "band",
      "label": "Fondo lila",
      "info": "Separa la sección del resto de la portada. Sin él, queda sobre blanco.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "prevent_animation",
